#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:1
msgid "Baoshan pre-investment / later equity project call"
msgstr "宝山先投后股项目征集"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:4
msgid "Convertible support | Baoshan"
msgstr "可转股支持｜宝山区"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:6
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "已截止"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S130 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw17239/20260109/77b6ebcf79044e2baee958a231dbcb7a.html>`_. "
"宝山人才政策月历·1月刊."
msgstr "`资料来源 S130 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw17239/20260109/77b6ebcf79044e2baee958a231dbcb7a.html>`_. 宝山人才政策月历·1月刊."

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与支持方式"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:13
msgid ""
"Amount and conversion terms require the actual project guide and agreement"
msgstr "额度及转股条件以项目指南及协议为准"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:15
msgid "Potential equity conversion; review contract"
msgstr "可能转为股权，须审核协议"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "申请条件与受理时间"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:20
msgid ""
"The district January 2026 policy calendar identifies a science-commission "
"call for pre-investment / later equity projects. Verify the recipient, "
"milestone and conversion conditions rather than labelling this an "
"unrestricted equity-free grant."
msgstr "2026年1月区级政策月历列有区科委“先投后股”项目征集。申请主体、阶段目标及转股条件需按指南和协议确认，不能作为无需出让股权、可自由使用的补助。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:22
msgid "Closed 10 February 2026"
msgstr "已于2026年2月10日截止"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "咨询与申请"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw17239/20260109/77b6ebcf79044e2baee958a231dbcb7a.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请渠道及政策文件 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw17239/20260109/77b6ebcf79044e2baee958a231dbcb7a.html>`_"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:29
msgid "Published consultation: +86 21 56160454."
msgstr "咨询电话：+86 21 56160454。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:33
msgid "Confirm the manager, sector, stage and legal-entity fit."
msgstr "确认基金管理人、投资领域、发展阶段及申请主体是否匹配。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:35
msgid ""
"Submit a deck, cap table, technology evidence, traction and financing "
"plan."
msgstr "提交路演材料、股权结构、技术验证结果、业务进展和融资计划。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:37
msgid "Complete commercial, financial, technical and legal due diligence."
msgstr "配合完成商业、财务、技术及法律尽职调查。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:39
msgid ""
"Review term sheet, investment committee conditions and definitive "
"agreements."
msgstr "审阅投资条款清单、投委会审议条件及正式协议。"

#: ../../funding/baoshan-conversion.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布额度是最高限额，不代表申请即可获得。申报前请核对适用通知、认可的费用发生期间、已获其他财政支持及书面拨付条件。"
